<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras off 2.16 pct after open.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras off 2.16 pct after open.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preferred stocks of state oil firm Petrobras fell 2.16 percent to 203.50 reais shortly after trade in the company resumed Friday on the Sao Paulo bourse, brokers said.</p>
</text>
